{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentGroupoidFunctor"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMarkovTrace_pairCoherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMarkovTrace_pairCoherent","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L144-L156","doc":"**The cell Markov trace is an orbit invariant**: every marking\nmorphism intertwines it by pullback, so trace values are well-defined\non marked-pair orbits — the first quantity certified safe for\npair-anonymous downstream consumption. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L138-L142","doc":"The Markov trace of the cell restriction at a marked pair — the\ntrace law of the tower square, as a pair-indexed functional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentBar_pairCoherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentBar_pairCoherent","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L131-L136","doc":"The conjugate leg is pair-coherent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_pairCoherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_pairCoherent","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L123-L129","doc":"The assignment family is pair-coherent — the engine restated in\nthe invariant language. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.PairCoherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.PairCoherent","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L113-L121","doc":"**The gauge discipline**: a pair-indexed family of functionals on\nstates is *pair-coherent* when every marking morphism intertwines it\nby pullback. A pair-coherent family descends to orbits of the\nmarked-pair groupoid — its values may be quoted without naming the\npair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_paste","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignment_paste","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L91-L109","doc":"**THE PASTED SQUARE**: rank-tower restriction composed with a\ngroupoid edge. The full-group assignment at the target pair, evaluated\non a state extended by zero from a parabolic containing both pairs,\nequals the parabolic assignment at the source pair on the transported\nstate. Proof: paste `tauAssignment_iotaPar_natural` with\n`tauAssignmentParabolic_hom_coherent`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentParabolic_hom_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.tauAssignmentParabolic_hom_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L74-L89","doc":"Groupoid coherence at the parabolic level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrictPar_hom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellRestrictPar_hom","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentOrbitInvariants.lean#L60-L72","doc":"Parabolic cell restriction transports along a marking morphism that\npreserves the parabolic. ","signatureChunk":0}]}